message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Exact accumulator widths for OCP MX dot products"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Al-Herani
    given-names: Amir
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-4962-3604"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/amiralherani/mx-dot-product-widths"
abstract: >-
  How wide a two's-complement accumulator has to be so that the sum of 32 element products in an OCP Microscaling (MX) dot product is exact, for every MX element format, with a script that derives the table from the bit encodings.
keywords:
  - OCP Microscaling
  - MX
  - MXFP4
  - MXFP8
  - computer arithmetic
  - dot product
